  "observationsNotClaimed": [
    "language: in Cantonese mode the workspace search field label and placeholder stay English, so complete copy and accessible-name coverage is not proven; row stays unverified.",
    "workspace heading in the dark theme at 1280x800 wraps the word Personalization mid-word (see options-personalization-theme-dark-1280x800.png); a layout defect, so material-design, accessibility-sizing and cheap-jor-matrix stay unverified.",
    "color-picker: a sweep of colours and opacities never produced a below-4.5:1 result because the palette adjusts text colour, so the claim that Apply is only offered at 4.5:1 or better has no observable negative case; row stays unverified.",
